## Thaw protocol (required before any frozen-file edit)

1. Architecture approval
2. `ROUTINE_ENGINE_CHANGE=true` or PR label `routine-engine-change`
3. `pnpm run check:routine-engine-certification`
4. Root cause · regression risk · rollback plan documented in PR

## Allowed without thaw

UI display (`kidschedule` timeline), analytics, premium gates, Amy Coach / Speech Coach / Gaming Hub — anything **above** the engine that does not alter timing behavior.

## No new engine layers

No new intelligence passes, validators, or timing abstractions until real-user data and architecture review justify it.
